From: Tracelane Bench <bench@tracelane.dev>
Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 19:27:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] gateways: add Tracelane + an OpenAI-route overhead scenario

Tracelane has no POST /v1/messages route (OpenAI-shaped
/v1/chat/completions only), so it cannot run the existing Anthropic-route
scenarios. scenarios/openai_overhead is a non-streaming variant of the
overhead measurement that runs on /v1/chat/completions instead, against
the same mock (which already serves both routes), so every gateway in the
comparison -- Tracelane included -- runs the identical scenario on a
route it actually has.
